        },
        {
          "text": "Muli-Kristo nguwenya mutupedwe lukono lwesu, mbubonya mbutwaakanzilwa mukulita kwayooyo uubamba makani oonse mbuli miyeeyo yamoyo wakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
